    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally positioned on a corner site within the mature and well-established development of Castlewood Gardens. Enjoying a particularly attractive position in a quiet cul-de-sac, this property offers a wonderful combination of comfortable living, privacy and convenience, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those seeking a well-located home in Carlow town.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged and comprises a welcoming reception hall, comfortable sitting room with double doors opening to the dining room, kitchen, utility, guest w.c., three bedrooms and family bathroom. A valuable additional feature is the attached garage, offering excellent storage or potential for a variety of uses, subject to any necessary consents.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a generous, well-maintained rear garden, providing an attractive setting for outdoor dining, relaxation and family enjoyment. Garden and private driveway to the front provides convenient off-street parking.\n\nPresented in excellent condition and enjoying a desirable corner position in this established residential setting, this property represents an appealing opportunity to acquire a comfortable family home in a convenient and accessible location.\n\nOutside \nLarge rear garden. \nOff street parking and garden to front. \nGarage attached. \nGarden shed. \n\nServices \nMains\nNGCH"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall (14.21ft x 5.87ft) with carpet fitted. Alarm keypad. <br>Sitting Room (13.98ft x 11.88ft) with wood flooring. Open fireplace. Double glass panel doors to Dining Room. <br>Dining Room (11.02ft x 10.30ft) with wood flooring. Double glass panel doors to Sitting Room. door access to Kitchen. <br>Kitchen (11.84ft x 11.02ft) with fitted low level units. Tiling to floor and splashback. <br>Utility Room Plumbed for appliances. Gas boiler. Exit door to side. Guest w.c., off. <br>Guest WC with w.c., w.h.b.. <br>Landing (9.97ft x 6.30ft) Carpet to stairs and landing. Airing cupboard. <br>Bedroom 1 (11.65ft x 10.56ft) with wood flooring. <br>Bedroom 2 (14.50ft x 10.01ft) with wood flooring. Two door fitted wardrobe with vanity and overhead storage. <br>Bedroom 3 (7.87ft x 7.81ft) with carpet fitted.<br>Bathroom (7.48ft x 6.86ft) Fully tiled with w.c., vanity w.h.b. and bath. Electric shower over bath. "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Garage attached\nGarden Shed\nExcellent corner site in a quiet cul-de-sac\nNGCH\nPvc Double Glazing\nMains - Electricity, Mains (or Group) Water\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER C\nBER No. 119878023\n Energy Performance Indicator: 215.80 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The location is particularly appealing, with Carlow town centre, a choice of schools, shops and everyday amenities all within easy reach. A nearby town bus service offers added convenience, while the N80 and M9 motorway via Junction 4 provide excellent connectivity for commuters travelling to surrounding towns and beyond.\n\n <small>Disclaimer: These particulars do not constitute nor constitute any part of an offer or a contract. They are issued on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through this office. All statements contained in these particulars as to this property are made without responsibility on the part of the Agents or the Vendor/Lessor. None of the statements contained in these particulars as to this property are to be relied on as statements or representations of fact. The particulars, various plans, photographs, descriptions and measurements (taken at longest room points) have been carefully prepared, but their accuracy is not guaranteed and any intending Purchasers/Lessees shall satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to their correctness. Map is for identification purposes only. No omission, accidental error or misconception shall be ground for a claim for compensation nor for the recession of the Contract by either the Vendor/Lessor or the Purchaser/Lessee.</small> \n"
      },
